# docs/evidence: default NO (COLLAB §三 提交纪律); only whitelisted dirs may be
# committed on purpose, heavy rebuild products stay excluded everywhere.
# To admit a new evidence dir: add `!docs/evidence/<sub>/` after the `aholo/*`
# re-ignore line, and re-ignore any heavy payloads it contains.
docs/evidence/*
!docs/evidence/aholo/
docs/evidence/aholo/*
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig/
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig-local/
!docs/evidence/aholo/sculpture-rig-tpose/
!docs/evidence/aholo/recheck-tearoom-3FO4K4RL8KM8/
!docs/evidence/aholo/xh02-0233-low/
!docs/evidence/aholo/xh02-0233-normal/
!docs/evidence/aholo/people02-hanfu/
